# A run belongs to whoever ran it, not to this repository. The set is the
# questions and the answer key; everything an arm produces -- the record, the
# transcripts, the write-up, the built report package -- stays out.
#
# The report package especially: it is a Malloy package, and nested inside
# examples/storefront its eval_run.malloy resolves duckdb.table('data/*.csv')
# against the STOREFRONT package root, which puts storefront itself into
# loadErrors so it serves nothing at all.
*/runs/
run-package-*/
